WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.105 --> 00:00:04.468
- Hey, Nick. We need a
fielder for softball.

00:00:04.468 --> 00:00:06.242
- Do you have a left handed mitt?

00:00:06.242 --> 00:00:08.467
- Naw, sorry, mate.

00:00:08.467 --> 00:00:10.043
- I guess I can't play, then.

00:00:10.043 --> 00:00:12.784
- Oh, no you can still be on the team.

00:00:12.784 --> 00:00:14.617
You can be our mascot.

00:00:18.280 --> 00:00:19.113
Yay.

00:00:28.447 --> 00:00:31.197
- Oh my god, are you left-handed?

00:00:42.961 --> 00:00:44.109
Did you know that left-handed people

00:00:44.109 --> 00:00:46.588
die ten years earlier
than right-handed people?

00:00:46.588 --> 00:00:48.505
It's a fact. Google it.

00:00:57.536 --> 00:00:58.786
Dude, watch it.

00:01:03.703 --> 00:01:04.620
- Wanna go?

00:01:08.427 --> 00:01:09.260
Ow!

00:01:14.936 --> 00:01:18.486
- Obama, Isaac Newton, Gandhi
they're all left-handed

00:01:18.486 --> 00:01:20.102
and they're influential as hell.

00:01:20.102 --> 00:01:21.097
- And then there's you.

00:01:21.097 --> 00:01:24.014
- Yeah, you're right. I'm a nobody.

00:01:32.968 --> 00:01:34.431
It's all right, I'm here for you.

00:01:34.431 --> 00:01:35.405
- What the hell?

00:01:35.405 --> 00:01:37.110
- We can die ten years earlier together.

00:01:37.110 --> 00:01:38.813
- Nick, seriously what are you doing?

00:01:38.813 --> 00:01:40.646
- I'm left-handed too.

00:01:40.646 --> 00:01:42.146
- Oh.
- [Nick] Yeah

